Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:57.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:01:00.57,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:03.53,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:06.54,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.50,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:12.59,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:15.63,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:17.63,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:24.39,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.31,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:38.19,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:44.12,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:50.12,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:56.38,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:02:04.51,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:16.69,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:27.00,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(323,165)\fscx48}A NEW FAMILY MEMBER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:41.49,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Its teeth are in him?! This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:43.24,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Explode, you pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.15,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:53.57,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,The bomb ended up in the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:54.78,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,The minister threw it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:57.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sorry about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll let you out later, so just stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.92,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,That geezer actually managed that?! No...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.47,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:14.67,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Why is it someone else? Did I mess up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:15.58,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We've got the plate number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:26.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,You're not getting away in {\i0}that{\i1} car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:28.26,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Your plan is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.49,0:03:31.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:34.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:37.92,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Did she head back toward \Nthe first pet shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:41.39,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't let her be found \Nby the terrorists again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:42.85,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I must catch up to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:45.91,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:48.28,main,Yor,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to Miss Anya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You won't get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:52.25,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Now people are falling from the sky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.47,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Move, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:08.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, hello. Is this the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:10.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I found one of the terrorists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,after he got into an accident in \Nan alley behind Northtown Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:15.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Would you kindly come fetch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:19.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I'm the housewife \Nthat called earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:20.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:27.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya! Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:34.02,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Despite everything that happened, \Nlooks like our work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.94,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Man, today sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:40.37,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Thankfully, none of this \Ncaused a huge commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:44.17,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The Eastern government should be working on\N erasing all signs that this ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.80,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Are we going to hand these dogs over?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.69,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That's not our concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:51.71,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,For now, we'll keep them at this \Nshop and report to the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:55.30,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We have plenty of things \Nwe need to look into.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:05:00.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to get back to my \Nfamily as quickly as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.18,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:16.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I thought you went to the adoption event.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.07,0:05:21.78,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I came back because you were \Ntaking too long in the potty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:25.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I was worried about Miss Anya,\N so I ran after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:27.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And... who is this dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:29.56,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:36.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So since all that happened, we didn't \Nexactly have time to look for a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:39.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,To think that these two got dragged \Ninto the incident, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry all this happened \Nwhile I was in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:43.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:47.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Your stomachache must have stemmed \Nfrom the breakfast I made this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:49.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:55.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,How many times must I tell you not to \Nrun off alone because it's dangerous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:59.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sowwy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:03.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So you're not hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:07.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog protected me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:12.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,So he must be another one of the \Ntest subjects from Project Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:16.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I can't let him run free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:31.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I thank you for saving my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:33.78,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.21,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We're from the State Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:40.37,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We're investigating the incident that \Noccurred in City Center earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:42.54,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,May we ask you a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:45.05,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:50.29,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Then it's safe to say that this dog was also \None of the dogs trained by the terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.74,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We'll take him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:54.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.26,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Also, this incident will not \Nbe revealed to the public,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:59.20,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,given the relationship between \Nthe East and the West,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:01.19,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,so I ask that you stay silent about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.99,0:07:03.83,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:08.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Now that things have settled down, \Nwhy don't we go back to searching for a puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:10.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're right. Okay, Anya—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:11.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants Mister Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:15.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:17.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to take care of Mister Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:19.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, that dog belonged to the bad gu—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But he saved Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:26.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But you're the one who \Nsaid you wanted a small dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But Anya wants Mister Dog now!\NIt's okay that Mister Dog is big!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:30.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Stop being difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:36.10,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If you don't let me have Mister Dog, \NI'll go bad and stop going to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.37,main,Loid and Sylvia,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:38.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.49,0:07:41.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing up school now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:45.31,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya, it's okay! It's okay, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:43.83,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:46.21,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,All right, very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:47.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Handl—er, ma'am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:53.75,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I highly doubt one of these dogs \Ngoing missing will cause any issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:57.91,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The terrorists have all been arrested, \Nand the dog didn't actually cause any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:58.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:02.59,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,As things stand, Operation Strix is \Nin danger. What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:04.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:07.20,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,He'll be under your supervision. \NKeep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:10.07,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The other dogs we have will be more \Nthan enough for our investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:10.92,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,so this isn't an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:13.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you really trying to \Ngive me even more work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:15.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,There were a lot of other Mister Dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:18.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Are the police ociffers \Ngoing to be mean to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.89,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Don't worry your pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:28.21,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The dogs will be well taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:32.07,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,They'll be given soft beds and warm meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:36.93,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'm sure these dogs have had very hard lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:43.07,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,So make sure you take really good \Ncare of this pup here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:44.43,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Let's promise each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.80,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Fank you very much, important lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:56.55,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,She's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You have no idea what I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.95,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:03.21,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I also had a daughter about her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:06.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Isn't that wonderful, Miss Anya? Mister Puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.47,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Thank goodness today ended peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:23.76,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:31.49,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,For now, we will be taking the dog for \Nthe night to check him for illnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:35.15,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,If there are no issues, we'll send \Nhim to your place in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:36.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.19,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Now, shall we head home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:42.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes. It's been a very long day,\Nand I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This field trip doesn't \Nend until we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:46.28,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:49.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Did you learn that at school? \NThis isn't a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:51.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This incident has already \Nbeen taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:06.80,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Today, I defeated a bad guy \Nand protected the peace
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.49,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,of this country without anyone knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:14.35,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa was able to stop the \Nbombing because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.13,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya saved the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:21.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We protected the relationship between\N the East and the West, to an extent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:23.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But physically, I'm done. \NMy stomach hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:26.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:33.21,italicstop,Announcer,0,0,0,,And now, our next story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:35.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I hope Mister Dog comes home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:37.75,italicstop,Announcer,0,0,0,,Last night, two traffic accidents \Noccurred in the city, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I hope Mister Dog comes home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I hope Mister Dog comes home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.19,0:10:40.41,italicstop,Announcer,0,0,0,,Though the incidents seem unrelated,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:43.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Calm down. He'll be here soon.\N And I can't see the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:44.56,italicstop,Announcer,0,0,0,,the police are investigating \Nfor more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:47.57,main,Member,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.57,0:10:49.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.57,main,Member,0,0,0,,Please take good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:00.25,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He seems very curious about where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:05.02,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wellycome to Anya's house, Mister Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:07.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is now your home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:10.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You know, we should probably \Ngive him a proper name now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:12.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Name...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:12.88,flashback,Researcher A,0,0,0,,Number 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:14.25,flashback,Researcher A,0,0,0,,Get out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:16.80,flashback,Researcher A,0,0,0,,It's time for your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.27,flashback,Researcher B,0,0,0,,Damn it, hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.40,flashback,Researcher C,0,0,0,,Here's your food. You better be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:24.89,flashback,Researcher D,0,0,0,,Raise the voltage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:26.01,flashback,Researcher E,0,0,0,,But any more will...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:29.28,flashback,Researcher D,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Even if this dog dies, \Nthere are more where he came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:40.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Are you nervous? Want a treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:44.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's okay. You're one of the Holgers now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:54.87,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:00.85,italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,The summit that began yesterday \Nis now beginning its second day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:04.38,italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,and it appears that disarmament \Nnegotiations are going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:12.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I won't get any stars even though \NI helped beat the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:18.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,To make sure the East and the West keep \Ngetting along, we have to keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't go talking about it at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:24.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The police will come get you, \Nand you'll never get to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:30.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And after we saved the world together, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:33.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Come, now, Miss Anya. It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.23,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If I can't have any stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:41.00,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The Friendship Scheme is the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:45.73,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'll go to Second Son's house and \Nmake Papa's mission a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.20,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What?! You got a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:52.63,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Let's see which one of our dogs \Nis bigger! Bring him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:57.58,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna keep saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:02.77,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Good morning, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:04.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Morning, pwease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:09.53,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. Looks like she's \Ngotten over her Starlight phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:10.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hear me, Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:14.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A dog has appeared at Anya's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.70,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Wait, really?! Ooh, what's it like?!\N What breed is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Some white kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:20.96,main,Becky,0,0,0,,How old is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:23.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Dunno. He's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:26.58,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's more precious \Nthan my little Wiesel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:28.42,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I hope they can play together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:29.75,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:32.86,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey, can I come over to your house...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.34,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Uh, hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.63,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:43.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:47.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I have a dog now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:51.78,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yeah, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:01.02,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The world is doomed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:03.99,main,Emile,0,0,0,,A single phrase to bring \Na commoner to her knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.88,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Brilliant, Lord Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:08.23,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? Did I say something that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:09.83,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,I marvel at your wit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:10.12,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:14.04,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Sniffle, sniffle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:13.08,main,Emile,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's just some filthy mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:20.24,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What's... the dog's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:27.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,His name...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.77,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess I don't mind asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:40.88,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You're not worthy of owning \Na dog. I've wasted my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:42.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:48.08,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:50.58,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You want to know how to name a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:55.32,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hmm... Maybe name him \Nafter a cute food or a flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:58.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Food... Peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:01.71,main,Becky,0,0,0,,But your doggie is really big, right? \N"Peanuts" might be weird, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.49,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You need to consider his appearance, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:05.47,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Appearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:07.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Old Man Hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:12.29,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You might be better off letting \Nyour mama or papa name him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has bad taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:25.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, Mama, Anya has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my. You're such good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:36.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Save me! He's gonna eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:38.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Maybe we should take him for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:39.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:43.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There's a dog park near the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:49.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Woof, woof, woof-woof! Woof, woof, woof-woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:52.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Anya wants to hold the leash, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:56.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're not ready for that. \NHe'll drag you around everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Though he's been trained before, \Nhe still needs household training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:03.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You'll need to learn lots of things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:07.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Like how to feed him, praise him,\Nscold him, et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:10.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You need to be prepared to \Ntake care of him until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:11.47,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.99,main,Loid,0,0,0,,By the way, have you come \Nup with a name for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:17.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My naming abilities are dismal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:18.61,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh? All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:23.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A simple name that's easy for him to \Nunderstand and for us to say would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Apparently, dogs can't tell \Nconsonants apart very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:29.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,so we'd be better off giving him \Na name with strong vowel sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Especially A, U, or O.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:34.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:37.63,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,They can't tell causes of death apart well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to bleed to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Or perhaps be crushed to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:45.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Stop being so unreasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:49.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess we can figure that out once \Nwe know more about his personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:00.57,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A dog park!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.53,0:17:07.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:13.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Run around and play, Mister Dog! \NOr this will just be an Anya park!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.38,main,Girl,0,0,0,,Here we go, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:16.60,main,Girl,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:22.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog! We'll do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:29.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:40.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Maybe this doesn't work \Nif you don't have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:48.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What is this Mister Dog's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:50.68,main,Anya,0,0,0,,How did you pick its name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:52.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Tell me your secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:54.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't run off too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:18:01.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Your name is Lucky Vanilla Princess III!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:06.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Then how about Atomic Angel Charlie General?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:10.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya seems to be having a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:15.90,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,"Be prepared to take care\N of him until the end."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.25,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I may have no right to say those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:27.92,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Once this mission is over, there will\N be no more use for the Forgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:30.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,My relationship with these two ends there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.62,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll do my best to \Nfollow up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.83,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But this terrorist incident \Nhas reminded me yet again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:40.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,that this peace between the East and the West
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.19,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,is nothing more than a façade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:45.83,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I must ensure that this cold war \Nends as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:47.59,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That will be the optimal future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:51.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, it's time to head home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:55.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You'll be studying once we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.45,0:18:59.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh, wha? Oh no, oh no, oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:04.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I lost my gloves. Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Did you drop them somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:08.63,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Those are Anya's favorites!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:17.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't see them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:26.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's gloves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:27.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:32.24,italics,Bulldog,0,0,0,,Me find! My precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:50.33,main,Old lady,0,0,0,,How dare you?! What do you think \Nyou're doing to my sweet baby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.80,main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Get lost, you stupid stray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:54.60,main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Aw, did he scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:19:59.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mister Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.01,0:20:03.05,flashback,Bondman,0,0,0,,I've returned with the tummy warmer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:05.87,flashback,Bondman,0,0,0,,that was stolen by the evil \Norganization, Princess Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:08.22,flashback,Princess Honey,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:12.01,flashback,Princess Honey,0,0,0,,It is a very important gift that \Nmy late mother gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:15.63,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You're like Bondman. \NYou got these back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:19.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. You're wearing gloves, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:22.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:27.43,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! I know Mister Dog's name now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.80,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog's name is Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:39.19,main,Loid,0,0,0,,"Bond" from "Bondman," eh? Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:41.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:45.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It looks like he approves! \NAnd his collar fits perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:53.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okay, Bond. I will now give \Nyou your first mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:55.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Eat every last kibble of this dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:00.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't give him too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That was neither good nor bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:13.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ah, you need to go potty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:15.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Follow me, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:20.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Behold, this is your potty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:24.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If you go anywhere else, Mama might get \Nmad, 'cause she likes everything tidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.73,0:21:27.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So be cautious as you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:37.47,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He had to poo. Stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:42.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okay, Bond. We'll be \Nwatching this cartoon next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I will teach you of your roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.01,0:21:48.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you that you need to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:51.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You'd better be ready by \Nthe time I finish my bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:56.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Those little...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:09.06,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid, Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:12.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:13.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:17.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,They wore themselves out \Nplaying and fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:21.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness! Is this a \Nlittle angel in our midst?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess we'll let her off the hook for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:27.39,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Indeed.
